see "../src/rng.vox".
see "../src/gen_literals.vox".
see "../src/gen_manifest.vox".
see "../src/gen_core.vox".
see "../src/gen_buffers.vox".
see "../src/gen_files.vox".
see "../src/gen_collections.vox".
see "../src/gen_text.vox".
see "../src/gen_things.vox".
see "../src/gen_flow.vox".
see "../src/gen_misc.vox".
see "../src/gen_process.vox".
see "../src/gen_expressions.vox".
see "../src/gen_keywords.vox".
see "../src/gen_basics.vox".

(process leaves, batch B - docs/ledger/process-control.md rows PRC-11,
 47, 48, 55, 60, 61, 87. Kinds 350, 351, 353, 354 registered (352,
 355-359 spare); kind 269 is also registered this batch (Reboot-only fix
 to a batch-A leaf, see gen_process.vox).

 Kind 352 ('gen leaf process reap without waiting', PRC-50/51/52/53/54)
 is written but held OUT of the dispatch - a layout-randomiser candidate
 this batch found, reported in full in REPORT-LEAVES-PROCESS-B.md and in
 the leaf's own comment. This test still calls it DIRECTLY (as it would
 any other leaf) to prove the leaf itself is correct, exactly ordinarily
 laid out; the held-out kind range at the bottom of this file therefore
 expects 352 to emit 0 bytes THROUGH DISPATCH even though the direct
 call above it emits plenty.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself, the
 same convention tests/450_gen_process_a.vox uses. The scratch-gated
 leaf (350) needs gen_scratch_flag/gen_does_file_io set by hand, the same
 way that test's buffer/directory leaves do, since this test drives
 leaves directly rather than through 'gen program'. gen_process_has_reaped
 is this file's own per-program state and is reset by hand between cases
 for the same reason 450 does.)

Set gen_scratch_flag to "'the workspace'".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.

Print "--- PRC-79: system control refusal, Reboot only now ---".
'rng seed' of 14.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process system control refusal' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- PRC-11: directory create/remove/change-directory failure paths ---".
'rng seed' of 20.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process directory failure paths' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 20.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process directory failure paths' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- PRC-11 with no file I/O committed: stands aside ---".
Set gen_does_file_io to false.
'rng seed' of 20.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process directory failure paths' of "" and false.
Print "emits a directory statement: {'gen text contains' of \"directory\"}".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.

Print "--- PRC-47, 48: reap by a specific pid, real child and foreign pid ---".
Set gen_process_has_reaped to false.
'rng seed' of 21.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process reap by pid' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a different seed (other spelling draws) ---".
Set gen_process_has_reaped to false.
'rng seed' of 22.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process reap by pid' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- PRC-50, 51, 52, 53, 54: non-blocking reap without waiting (HELD OUT of dispatch - direct call only, see the leaf's own comment) ---".
Set gen_process_has_reaped to false.
'rng seed' of 23.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process reap without waiting' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a different seed (other spelling draws) ---".
Set gen_process_has_reaped to false.
'rng seed' of 24.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process reap without waiting' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- PRC-60, 61, 55: reaped and waiting stay ordinary identifiers ---".
Set gen_process_has_reaped to false.
'rng seed' of 25.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process reaped ordinary identifier' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- PRC-87: empty-path degenerate input, one construct per draw ---".
'rng seed' of 26.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process empty path refusal' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a different seed ---".
'rng seed' of 27.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process empty path refusal' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a third seed ---".
'rng seed' of 28.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf process empty path refusal' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- registration reachable: kinds 350-359 all dispatch without error ---".
a number called 'the kind' is 350.
While 'the kind' is less than 360,
    clear gen_out,
    'gen dispatch leaf' of 'the kind' and "" and false,
    Print "kind {'the kind'}: {gen_out's length} bytes emitted",
    Set 'the kind' to 'the kind' add 1.
